<!-- 01 · OVERVIEW                                                        -->
<!-- ================================================================== -->
<section class="section section--paper" aria-labelledby="s1-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="split__aside">
        <h2 class="split__title rv" id="s1-title">Comprehensive Cloud Security Services for AWS, Azure and Google Cloud</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="split__body prose">
        <p class="rv">Cloud environments require continuous security assessment to protect business data, applications and infrastructure from misconfigurations, unauthorized access and evolving cyber threats. CipherTrivia delivers cloud security services that help organizations identify vulnerabilities, reduce attack surfaces and strengthen cloud infrastructure across Amazon Web Services (AWS), Microsoft Azure and Google Cloud Platform (GCP).</p>
        <p class="rv">Our cloud security assessments cover Identity and Access Management (IAM) reviews, cloud configuration audits, network security and segmentation, data protection, workload security and security logging and monitoring. We evaluate access permissions and cloud resource configurations to identify excessive privileges, insecure storage, exposed services and other security gaps that could compromise critical digital assets.</p>
        <p class="rv">CipherTrivia also provides cloud vulnerability assessments and compliance mapping against CIS Benchmarks and relevant cloud security frameworks. Our cloud architecture reviews reference the AWS Well-Architected Framework and applicable Azure and GCP security best practices to identify control gaps and recommend risk-based remediation measures. These services help businesses strengthen access controls, improve threat detection and support regulatory compliance across public, private and hybrid cloud environments.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="figure-wide rv">
      <img class="media-img" src="/assets/images/cloud-security-services/wide.webp" width="2400" height="1000" alt="City skyline at night beneath a network of connected cloud services" loading="lazy">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

