<!-- 02 · WHAT'S INCLUDED                                                 -->
<!-- ================================================================== -->
<section class="section section--white" id="whats-included" aria-labelledby="s2-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="shead">
      <div class="shead__meta">
      </div>
      <div class="shead__body">
        <h2 class="shead__title rv" id="s2-title">What's Included in Our Cloud Security Services</h2>
        <p class="shead__lede rv" style="--d:1">Our cloud security services cover critical security controls across your cloud infrastructure, from identity and access management to threat detection and compliance. CipherTrivia assesses AWS, Microsoft Azure and Google Cloud environments to identify misconfigurations, reduce attack surfaces and strengthen cloud security through practical, risk-based recommendations.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="ledger ledger--3">
      <article class="ledger__cell rv">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("identity") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">IAM &amp; Identity Review</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We assess Identity and Access Management (IAM) controls to verify that users and applications have only the permissions they need. Our review covers user roles, service accounts, federated access and multi-factor authentication (MFA) to identify excessive privileges, inactive accounts and weak access controls that could lead to unauthorized access or privilege escalation.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("sliders") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Cloud Configuration &amp; Drift Audit</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We review cloud resource configurations across AWS, Azure and GCP to identify security weaknesses and settings that deviate from approved security standards. The assessment covers insecure storage, exposed services, weak encryption and configuration drift across virtual machines, databases and managed cloud services, with checks aligned to CIS Benchmarks and cloud provider best practices.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("network") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Network Security &amp; Segmentation Review</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We examine cloud network architecture to identify unnecessary exposure and weaknesses in communication between systems. Our assessment covers Virtual Private Clouds (VPCs), subnets, security groups, firewalls, routing rules and load balancers to verify that network access is properly restricted and public-facing applications remain appropriately separated from internal workloads.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("pulse") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Cloud Logging &amp; Monitoring Assessment</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We assess logging and monitoring controls to determine how effectively cloud environments record activity and detect suspicious events. Our review covers audit logs, security event collection, alerting and monitoring configurations across AWS, Azure and GCP to identify visibility gaps that could delay threat detection, incident investigation and security response.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("target") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Cloud Vulnerability &amp; Risk Assessment</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We identify security vulnerabilities across cloud infrastructure, applications and workloads by examining exposed endpoints, outdated software, insecure services and potential attack paths. Findings are prioritized according to severity, exploitability and business impact so technical teams can address critical risks first and improve the overall security of their cloud environments.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("clipboard") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Cloud Compliance &amp; Architecture Review</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We evaluate cloud security controls against CIS Benchmarks and applicable regulatory requirements while reviewing architecture against the AWS Well-Architected Framework and relevant Azure and GCP security guidance. The assessment identifies compliance gaps, architectural weaknesses and missing security controls, followed by prioritized remediation recommendations that support stronger security and regulatory readiness.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

