<!-- 04 · COMMON RISKS                                                    -->
<!-- ================================================================== -->
<section class="section section--stone" aria-labelledby="s4-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="shead">
      <div class="shead__meta">
      </div>
      <div class="shead__body">
        <h2 class="shead__title rv" id="s4-title">Common Cloud Security Risks We Assess</h2>
        <p class="shead__lede rv" style="--d:1">Cloud security risks can expose business data and applications to cyberattacks when security settings are weak or access is not properly controlled. As a cloud security company, CipherTrivia helps businesses identify these weaknesses across AWS, Microsoft Azure and Google Cloud. Our cloud security services focus on common risks that can affect data protection, system availability and business operations.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="triggers">
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("unlock", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Unauthorised Access &amp; Excessive Permissions</h3>
        <div class="trigger__text">
          <p>When users have more access than they need, sensitive business information can fall into the wrong hands. We review user access and security permissions to identify weaknesses and help prevent unauthorized access to critical cloud resources.</p>
          <p class="trigger__why"><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Better access control helps protect business accounts and confidential information.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("database", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Cloud Storage &amp; Data Exposure</h3>
        <div class="trigger__text">
          <p>Incorrect storage settings can make private files and business data accessible to people who should not have access. We check cloud storage and database security to identify exposed information and recommend improvements to data protection.</p>
          <p class="trigger__why"><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Secure cloud storage helps reduce data leaks and protect customer information.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("shield-crack", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Weak Cloud Network Security</h3>
        <div class="trigger__text">
          <p>Poor network security can expose applications and internal systems to unwanted connections. We assess cloud network settings to identify unnecessary access points and recommend improvements that help keep critical systems protected.</p>
          <p class="trigger__why"><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Strong network security reduces exposure to external threats and limits unauthorized access.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("eye-off", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Gaps in Security Monitoring</h3>
        <div class="trigger__text">
          <p>Without proper monitoring, suspicious activity may go unnoticed and security incidents can take longer to investigate. We review cloud logging and monitoring practices to identify gaps that could prevent teams from detecting potential threats in time.</p>
          <p class="trigger__why"><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Better monitoring helps businesses identify unusual activity and respond to security risks sooner.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("container", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Cloud Application &amp; Container Security</h3>
        <div class="trigger__text">
          <p>Security weaknesses in cloud applications and container environments can expose business systems to cyber threats. We assess application configurations and access controls to identify common security issues and recommend improvements that help protect cloud-based applications.</p>
          <p class="trigger__why"><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Secure applications help reduce vulnerabilities and support reliable business operations.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("key", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Exposed Passwords &amp; Security Keys</h3>
        <div class="trigger__text">
          <p>Poorly managed passwords, API keys and other sensitive credentials can give unauthorized users access to business systems. We review how these credentials are stored and managed to identify weaknesses and recommend safer security practices.</p>
          <p class="trigger__why"><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Proper credential management helps protect business accounts and critical cloud resources.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

