<!-- 05 · PROCESS                                                         -->
<!-- ================================================================== -->
<section class="section section--ink" aria-labelledby="s5-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="process">
      <div class="process__aside">
        <h2 class="process__title" id="s5-title">How Does a Cloud Security Assessment Work?</h2>
        <p class="process__lede">Our cloud security assessment process helps businesses identify security weaknesses and understand how to protect their cloud infrastructure, applications and sensitive data. As a premier cloud security company, CipherTrivia follows a structured approach to assess cloud environments across AWS, Microsoft Azure and Google Cloud Platform (GCP), providing practical recommendations to reduce security risks.</p>
      </div>

      <ol class="process__list" data-process>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Understand Your Cloud Environment</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We review your cloud infrastructure, applications and data storage to understand how your systems are set up and identify the areas that need security assessment.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Identify Security Weaknesses</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We examine cloud settings, user permissions, network access and data protection controls to find misconfigurations and weaknesses that could expose your business to cyber threats.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Evaluate Risks &amp; Business Impact</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We assess identified issues based on their severity and potential impact on your business. This helps distinguish critical security risks from lower-priority issues that can be addressed later.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Deliver Assessment Findings</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We provide a clear report of identified security gaps and explain why they matter. The findings include prioritized recommendations to help your team understand what needs attention and how to address it.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Guide Security Improvements</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We recommend practical remediation measures to strengthen cloud security and reduce future risks. Your team can use these recommendations to improve access controls, correct configuration issues and strengthen data protection.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

